<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<p>Basically, a big &quot;lake&quot; feeds off people's sense of self, using this wounded deer as a lure.<br />
Thus, to contain it, it must be referred to as a recipe, and utilizing &quot;You&quot; - that way, it can't really tell you're talking about it.<br />
It's a parallel story of both your POV, a Jr Researcher, and the people who first discovered the lake back when it was much, much smaller both falling prey to it.</p>
